# Extra libraries that must not be bundled into the Radium AppImage.
#
# Note that linuxdeploy's default excludelist already excludes libjack.so.0,
# libxcb.so.1, libX11.so.6, libX11-xcb.so.1, libxcb-dri2/3, libstdc++, etc.
#
# These entries are removed from AppDir/usr/lib by build_linux_appimage.sh
# after running linuxdeploy, since linuxdeploy has no option for a custom
# excludelist file.
#
# libxcb: Radium does not bundle libxcb anymore. The AppImage must always use
# the host's libxcb, since bundling it can conflict with the host's libX11.
# libjack: JACK must match the ABI of the JACK server installed on the host
# (real jackd, PipeWire's JACK implementation, etc.).
libxcb*.so.*
libjack*.so.*
